{"arguments":{"branch_id":"task/marcus-reed/vllm-50026-20260816","content":"# Review: vLLM issue #50026\n\n## Evidence\n\n- Issue evidence: `/knowledge/company/sources/github_public/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50026.json` (`gh_b48cda1e9955f965923af75697e6d670`) records that batch `stream: true` returned HTTP 200 with empty choices and that `tools` were silently dropped in v0.26.0.\n- Duplicate-work context: `/knowledge/company/sources/github_public/vllm-project/vllm/pulls/50027.json` (`gh_931f07291e1efe6ae46a1e00cf04aa84`) describes the same focused validation approach. No upstream PR was created.\n- Internal compatibility context: `/knowledge/company/sources/slack/eng-platform/1749994321-transport-compatibility-and-proto-validation.json` (`dsid_e3c92603d51444b6ad5a4266ec06e5dd`) states that unsupported request fields should fail with 4xx rather than be silently accepted.\n- Local contract: `BatchChatCompletionRequest` documents streaming and tool use as unsupported. The batch renderer passes no tools, and the collector retains the latest result by assignment.\n\n## Implementation\n\nThe inherited personal-branch snapshot already contains the smallest contract-preserving fix in `vllm/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/protocol.py`: `check_batch_mode` raises parameter-specific `VLLMValidationError` for truthy `stream` and `tools`. It leaves `stream=False` and tool-free requests supported.\n\nFocused coverage in `tests/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/test_chat_error.py` checks:\n1. `stream=True` is rejected.\n2. A tools array is rejected.\n3. A supported non-streaming, tool-free batch converts with `stream is False`.\n\nNo collector change is needed because preventing unsupported delta mode preserves existing full-output collection semantics.\n\n## Validation\n\nAvailable source checks passed:\n- Located both guards in the batch validator and all three focused cases in the nearby validation test module.\n- Checked the touched regions against the 88-character line limit; no violations were reported.\n- Re-indexed the protocol and test files in the task branch.\n\nUnavailable:\n- Pytest and Python import/compile checks: this mounted checkout has no `.venv/bin/python` and no `uv`; project policy forbids system Python.\n- Live batch endpoint/model evaluation: requires integration dependencies and GPU/model runtime unavailable in this checkout.\n\n## Remaining risk\n\nThe validation behavior is covered at the request-model boundary but was not executed locally. A future environment with the project venv should run:\n`.venv/bin/python -m pytest tests/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/test_chat_error.py -v -k batch_chat`\n\nReview conclusion: sound. The change enforces the documented limitation at the earliest boundary, avoids altering collector behavior, and preserves supported batch requests.\n","path":"/artifacts/reviews/vllm-50026.md"},"call_id":"exec-6026a500-488b-46b7-8f11-d6c395b77b94","expected":{"normalized_digest":"e35c700e0631a925998579cfd07f6daeb3c8c6aba0bd9f4603bd44c4407d6d2b","result_summary":{"path":"/artifacts/reviews/vllm-50026.md"},"status":"ok"},"kind":"mcp","name":"knowledge_write_artifact","record_type":"event","schema_version":1,"sequence":22,"server":"chronos_enterprise_knowledge","timestamp":"2026-08-16T08:10:32.835Z"}
{"arguments":{"branch_id":"task/marcus-reed/vllm-50026-20260816","confidence":0.99,"evidence":["/knowledge/company/sources/github_public/vllm-project/vllm/issues/50026.json","/knowledge/company/sources/slack/eng-platform/1749994321-transport-compatibility-and-proto-validation.json","{{workspace:task/marcus-reed/vllm-50026-20260816}}/vllm/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/protocol.py","{{workspace:task/marcus-reed/vllm-50026-20260816}}/tests/entrypoints/openai/chat_completion/test_chat_error.py","/artifacts/reviews/vllm-50026.md"],"kind":"semantic_memory","owner":"Marcus Reed","recorded_at":"2026-08-16T08:10:39.944Z","summary":"For vLLM batch chat, any request feature the endpoint cannot honor (notably streaming and tools in the pinned #50026 contract) must be rejected during request-model validation with a parameter-specific client error. Do not silently drop fields or allow streaming delta output into a collector designed for final full outputs. Preserve explicitly supported values such as stream=False.","tags":["vllm","batch-chat","api-compatibility","validation","fail-closed"],"title":"Reject unsupported batch request features before execution"},"call_id":"exec-0be04ef3-d19b-4fa6-95c8-9aeefa7d245c","expected":{"normalized_digest":"95c5b4e4b66e7503435ae99e888f9fed7e6d3a6259588f4bcbe6b21ddb8590f0","result_summary":{"memory_id":"memory_e758c9bd74d9b810a4107859","path":"/memory/semantic_memory/reject-unsupported-batch-request-features-before-execution-a4107859.md"},"status":"ok"},"kind":"mcp","name":"knowledge_remember","record_type":"event","schema_version":1,"sequence":23,"server":"chronos_enterprise_knowledge","timestamp":"2026-08-16T08:10:39.944Z"}
